				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-896ff58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="896ff58" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Read some of the feedback received from readers of the books by Ferdouse Khaleque</p>								</div>
